                "name": "SummarizationSetBy",
                "value": "Automatic"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "calculated",
            "name": "Session Model Tier",
            "dataType": "string",
            "description": [
              "The most capable model tier a session ran on - one value per session, every tool.",
              "Row-level 'Model Cost Tier' changes within a session (235 of 1,930 Cowork sessions carry",
              "a Frontier row next to an unlogged one), so counting sessions by it double-counts them.",
              "Here any Frontier row makes the session Frontier, else any mid-cost row makes it",
              "Workhorse, else it is Not attributed (no model name logged anywhere in the session).",
              "",
              "Read as the session's lowest Model Cost Tier Sort (0 Frontier, 1 Workhorse, 8/9 unlogged or",
              "unknown) - one storage-engine MIN per thread instead of a table scan per row. Proven identical",
              "to the earlier CONTAINS lookup on all 1,930 Cowork sessions.",
              "",
              "ESTATE FACT. Frontier occurs only in Cowork here: Copilot logs GPT-5 (Next Gen) or no model,",
              "agents the same, so outside Cowork a session is Workhorse or Not attributed. GPT-5 (Next Gen)",
              "names the model family, not its reasoning mode, so \"mid cost\" may understate what ran."
            ],
            "expression": [
              "VAR _mn = CALCULATE(MIN('Chat + Agent Interactions (Audit Logs)'[Model Cost Tier Sort]), ALLEXCEPT('Chat + Agent Interactions (Audit Logs)', 'Chat + Agent Interactions (Audit Logs)'[ThreadId]))",
              "RETURN",
              "    SWITCH(",
              "        TRUE(),",
              "        _mn = 0, \"Frontier (premium cost)\",",
              "        _mn = 1, \"Workhorse (mid cost)\",",
              "        \"Not attributed\"",
              "    )"
            ],
            "sortByColumn": "Session Model Tier Sort",
            "lineageTag": "fc0000c1-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
            "summarizeBy": "none",
            "annotations": [
              {
                "name": "SummarizationSetBy",
                "value": "Automatic"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "calculated",
            "name": "Session Model Tier Sort",
            "dataType": "int64",
            "description": [
              "Sort key for Session Model Tier: Frontier 1, Workhorse 2, Not attributed 3.",
              "Derived from the same session lookup as the tier, never from the tier column itself:",
              "reading 'Session Model Tier' here creates a circular dependency (the tier's context",
              "transition depends on this column). Same pattern as Session Turn Band Sort."
            ],
            "isHidden": true,
            "expression": [
              "VAR _mn = CALCULATE(MIN('Chat + Agent Interactions (Audit Logs)'[Model Cost Tier Sort]), ALLEXCEPT('Chat + Agent Interactions (Audit Logs)', 'Chat + Agent Interactions (Audit Logs)'[ThreadId]))",
              "RETURN",
              "    SWITCH(",
